# `.env.example` lists the settings of the Warped cloud deploy; copy it to `.env` (git-ignored) and
# fill it in. `make` in this folder reads `.env`.
#
# Interface:
#     GCP_PROJECT_ID: the Google Cloud project's ID (not its name or number).
#     GCP_REGION, GCP_ZONE: where the game server runs; e2-micro is free only in us-central1,
#         us-west1 and us-east1.
#     MONTHLY_BUDGET_USD: the budget whose alerts email the billing account's admins.
#     GAME_PASSWORD: the password players type in the app; `make deploy-everything` writes a
#         random one here when it is missing. Share it only with players.
#
# Example:
#     cp .env.example .env
GCP_PROJECT_ID=warped-zq607d
GCP_REGION=us-central1
GCP_ZONE=us-central1-a
MONTHLY_BUDGET_USD=30
GAME_PASSWORD=
